# SAEF lives inside the AutoTest GitHub monorepo.
# Keep engineering governance, approved work products, ADR/CR and text evidence.
# Original raw PDF/ZIP firmware/schematics are intentionally NOT committed to this public repository.
# To make the entire SAEF recoverable, register and verify those assets in an approved protected store.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/engineering/
/engineering/*
!/engineering/control/
!/engineering/work-products/
!/engineering/decisions/
!/engineering/change-requests/
!/engineering/evidence/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.pdf
*.log
*.bin
*.hex
*.o
*.obj
*.pdb
